Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:34.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的主人布兰顿想今晚邀请你来 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Brandon ask that you attend this evening,so will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:35.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}潘宁顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pennington!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:37.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}索思韦尔兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ah,the Southwells!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:40.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你主人波林怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's your master,Boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:42.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是洛克福特勋爵 潘宁顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's Lord Rochford to you,Pennington.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请称我为威廉·潘宁顿爵士 索思韦尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir William Pennington to you,Southwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:47.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你主人最近怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and how is your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:49.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}操他的布兰顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master fucking Brandon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:51.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是不是还非得用那种最恶毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he still persist in using the most foul
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:54.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最侮辱性的语言诋毁我主人的女儿 安妮女士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And abusive language against my master's daughter,Lady Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:57.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 她马上要做王后了 - 请你自己去问公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Who is soon to be Queen? - The Duke can speak for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:02:00.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我在问你呢 潘宁顿 - 公爵不愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm asking you,Pennington! - His Grace wants nothing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.42,0:02:02.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与国王的娼妓成为王后一事有任何关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With the elevation of the King's whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:03.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁是妓女？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's a whore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:07.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 让我过去 - 先过了我这一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Let me pass! - Not till you've paid for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:11.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快跑 去找公爵 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run! Fetch the Duke! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}神父 我想在这里寻求避难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father,I seek sanctuary in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以 我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course,my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收起你们的剑 先生们 这是上帝的领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put up your swords,gentlemen. This is a place of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:51.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 拔剑自卫啊 潘宁顿 - 主啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Defend yourself, Pennington. - Dear God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.36,0:02:54.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这动武不仅侮辱了你服侍的波林家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You dishonour the Boleyn family whom you serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时也冒犯了上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you offend God by offering violence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:05.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住手 看在上帝的份上 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop now,for the love of God! Enough is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:19.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这个笨蛋 理查德 你把他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fool,Richard. You've killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:39.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 他们把他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,my Lord. They've killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杀人凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murderers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:47.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的大人 大人 我向你祈求 以主的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my Lord,my Lord,i beg you,in the name of our Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里已经发生了一起凶杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One murder has been committed here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:53.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 人渣 - 公爵大人 我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You scum. - Your Grace,we...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}闭嘴 你们两个该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut up! You're both dead men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:57.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我求求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord,listen! I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:00.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在教堂里行凶的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those who commit murder in Church
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会被上帝诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are damned in the eyes of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:16.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是你干的好事 波林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your doing,Boleyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:32.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮女士不希望受到打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Anne is not to be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:36.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一夜之间所有人都希望跟安妮女士扯上关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Suddenly everyone is beating a path to Lady Anne's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:38.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么看 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you suppose that is, Mr. Wyatt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:41.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为比起落日 人们更喜欢朝阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because everyone prefers a rising sun to a setting sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:42.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯米顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Smeaton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:46.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说说看 最近你在写什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now tell me,what are you writing at the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.21,0:04:48.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一首讽刺诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A satire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得这些事很可笑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You find all this funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有严肃的事情 都有可笑的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,it has its funny side, like all serious things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}举个例 你肯定觉得好笑 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For example-and this will make you laugh,Mark
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚刚接到克伦威尔先生的通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell just told me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已被任命为枢密院成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been appointed to the Privy Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:02.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太荒谬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生活本身就是荒谬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything in life is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从另一个方面看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to suppose otherwise is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:09.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这只是人性的虚荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's human vanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:11.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 怀特先生 - 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Wyatt. - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你猜怎么着？- 不 猜不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You know what? - No,i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:18.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最近忽然非常想吃苹果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a furious hankering for apples,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:21.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像我以前从未吃过似的 都三天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such as I've never had before. It started three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:25.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 苹果？- 是的 苹果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Apples? - Yes! apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:27.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王说这是我怀孕的征兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King told me it was a sign I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:30.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是我说才不是呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I said it was nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国那边有什么好消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What news from France?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:44.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么能令陛下满意的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}none to give Your Majesty any satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然法国国王答应代表陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although he promised to make representations to the Pope
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:48.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在教皇面前陈情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On Your Majesty's behalf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:49.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是实际上他没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King Francis did no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:52.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:55.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们还能指望法国国王怎样呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What else should we have expected from the King of France?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 现在我反而有了很好的理由…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fact is,I now have a good reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:01.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个非常好的理由 不用再等教皇的决定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A very good reason,not to wait for the Pope's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:05.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须立即公布我废除婚约的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The annulment of my marriage must be declared immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下现在已经是教会的领袖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,as Your Majesty is head of the Church now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:11.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 您自己就可以… - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You yourself could... - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}婚约取消仍然需要得到教会方面的同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The annulment should still be decided and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:15.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并应该由教会正式宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}declared by the Church proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是说 坎特伯雷大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is to say, the Archbishop of Canterbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:25.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下也知道 这个职位一直是空缺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Your Majesty knows, there remains a vacancy for that position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:28.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我心中已经有了满意的人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I know exactly who will suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.34,0:06:33.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克朗默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cranmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:37.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 什么事 - 您从德国运来的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes. - Your belongings from Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:40.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you. uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能不能… 谢谢你 先生 终于到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you could just... thank you,sir. At last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:53.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katharina.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:55.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.97,0:06:58.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你终于到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 见到你终于松了口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very relieved to see you,Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:06.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还以为我会死呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I was going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是非法妻子 这样旅行也真够呛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not the nicest way to travel,even for an illegal wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:13.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:19.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯原谅我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:38.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这… 这里就是英格兰了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so... this is England?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里就是英格兰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is England.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:47.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们想任命克朗默先生为大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want to make Cranmer Archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:51.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很好奇教皇是不是清楚克朗默在这的声誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder if the Pope knows of the reputation Cranmer has here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:55.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他全心全意为路德派运动尽力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For being devoted heart and soul to the Lutheran movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他曾经是波林家族的专任牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he was once chaplain to the Boleyns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该要求他特别宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He ought to be required to take a special oath
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 决不干涉离婚的事情 - 他当然会干涉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Not to meddle with the divorce. - Of course he'll meddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:05.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这才是他们的真正用意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们才不在乎神圣教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They don't care about Holy Church anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至已经不在乎人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They don't even care about the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:13.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王已被蒙蔽 除了上帝他无所畏惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King, in his blindness, fears no one but God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我担心王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear for the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:20.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说安妮·波林公开表示讨厌王后和公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say Anne Boleyn hates her openly and her daughter,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她曾经恐吓过公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's made threats against the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:25.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说这话时谨慎一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}those are dangerous words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:29.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也为你自己孩子们的性命着想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think also of the lives of your own children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:56.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反土著奴役教皇敕令 圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Bull Sublimus Dei,Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提示我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:02.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}废除奴役制度的提案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It forbids the enslavement
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:04.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解放新大陆地区的本地人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of the native peoples of the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这我们非常乐意签署\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we sign it very willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为事实上 坎佩基奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the fact is,Campeggio
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:15.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧洲国王们有权无德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the Kings of europe have power but no morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:18.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须主持公道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must act as their conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:21.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是我任性的孩子 我作为他们的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are my wilful children and I their father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要带领他们走向正义的道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leading them along the paths of righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:29.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿主庇佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So help me God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:43.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这个呢？- 英格兰国王申请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And this? - the King of England asks your approval
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:45.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任命新的坎特伯雷大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To appoint a new Archbishop of Canterbury,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:49.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接任已经去世的渥兰大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After the death of Archbishop Warham.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:51.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人们还说他不在乎呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and people say he doesn't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}候选人叫什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is the name of the candidate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:56.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·克朗默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:10:00.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对这克朗默有何了解？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do we know of this Cranmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:06.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知之甚少 他只是位小牧师 无名小卒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Virtually nothing. He's an obscure cleric. A nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.59,0:10:10.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很多传言说他私底下信奉路德教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are strong rumors that he is a secret Lutheran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:13.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们便不能批准他的任命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we should not approve his appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:17.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能 我也这么想 教皇陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Not in my opinion,Holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:19.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:23.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得给英国教会一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We want to give the English Church the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:27.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使其恢复对真正信仰的原有忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To return to its first allegiance,and our true faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:31.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得取悦国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We want to please the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:35.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得让他对我们感恩戴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We want to make him beholden to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:38.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么能比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What better way to please him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:44.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无名小卒的任命更令他高兴呢？再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Than to approve the appointment of a nobody? After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:49.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个无名之辈又能对教廷有什么威胁呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What harm can a nobody inflict upon our Holy Church?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:17.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:20.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴看到你被批准接任大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are most pleased to see you confirmed as Archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我承认对于接任此职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty,I confess I had some scruples
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:28.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还有所顾虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About accepting the office,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我必须得到教皇的恩准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since I must receive it at the Pope's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:33.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不必对罗马教廷尽忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not beholden to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:37.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需向上帝和我尽责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to God,and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:39.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now,Archbishop,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:42.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为本国神权管辖的首席大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as principle minister of spiritual jurisdiction in our realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:46.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你立即为我的要事做一劳永逸的了断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you to determine once and for all,my Great Matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:50.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的第一次婚姻是否有效？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whether or not my first marriage was valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我将立刻着手办理此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,I shall address the question with the greatest urgency,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽快宣判我的裁定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And presently pronounce my verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:10.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 陛下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Cromwell. - Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔已经离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since the departure of Thomas More,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰正缺一位大法官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}England has lacked a Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:21.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我相信你能担此重任 - 谢陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I am trusting you to fill that office. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:41.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在哪？沙福克在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he? Where's Suffolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:13:00.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在万能的主的面前 我们在此集结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are gathered here together,in the sight of God almighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:06.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见证他和她的神圣婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To join in Holy matrimony,this man and this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你们彼此宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will you both answer that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:10.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们从此正当结合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will keep all these coming days rightful,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:13.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明智而慎重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With right wiseness and discretion,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:16.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁慈而互信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With mercy and truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:19.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿吾主保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So help you God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:25.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布里列顿阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master Breredon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:31.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没用的 我失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's no use. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我再也无法忍受此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I can no longer bear this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:40.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就去你内心向往之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then go where your heart tells you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:45.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带着吾主的保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With God's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:58.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫尔宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The More
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:11.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 沙福克公爵觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady, Duke of Surffolk
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:18.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我奉王命至此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty has ordered me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:28.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下命我知会您…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's asked me to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:32.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他警告您别不必妄图再回到他身边…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He warns you not to try to return to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在已与安妮女士完婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since he is now married to the Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:40.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从今往后 您将禁用王后之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From henceforth,you must abstain from using the title of Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:43.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头衔改为威尔士亲王太妃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will now be referred to as the Princess Dowager of Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:50.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您必须减小日常开支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must also cut your household expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:57.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于慷慨 陛下允许您继续享有您的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In his generosity,the King allows you to keep your property,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:00.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但将不再继续支付仆人费用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But will no longer pay your servants' wages,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:03.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}及日常开支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or your household expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我的女儿呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:11.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 玛丽呢？我能见她吗？- 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What of Mary? May I see her? - Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.65,0:15:15.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宽恕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:28.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道吗 布兰顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know something, Mr. Bradon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:34.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我必须在极喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I had to choose between extreme happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:36.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与极悲之间做出选择…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And extreme sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:39.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我总会选择悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would always choose sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为当你快乐时 你会忘记…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For when you are happy you forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}忘记信仰 忘记上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forget about spiritual things; you forget about God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但当你悲伤时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But in your sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:57.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝总与你同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is always with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:08.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿吾主保佑 并与你同在 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May Lord bless you and keep you,my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要我一息尚存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As long as I live,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:45.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会永远称我为英格兰王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will call myself the Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:51.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 感谢上帝 - 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Deo gracias. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我有些消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace,I have some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:03.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得知克伦威尔先生将向议会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have learned that Mr. Cromwell is to present
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:04.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提交另一份议案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}another bill to parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:07.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于上诉限制的议案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Act of Restraint of Appeals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:09.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这看似无害的题目下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And under its innocuous title
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}隐藏着极为反动的意图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does it conceal its most revolutionary intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:15.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么写的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:18.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"英格兰领土作为一个帝国"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"This realm of England is an Empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:21.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"为教会最高领袖及国王所治"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"governed by one supreme head and King,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"只向上帝尽忠"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"And owing no allegiance except to God."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:28.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以后 事关精神领域的所有最终上诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In future,all final appeals on spiritual matters will be heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:30.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}均非到罗马 而止于英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not in rome,but in England,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:33.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即国王现在享有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the King will now enjoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:36.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"绝对 全然 而且至高的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"plenary,whole and entire power,pre-Eminence"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"权威 享有君主特权及裁决权"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"authority,prerogative and jurisdiction."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想那意味着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which means,I take it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法案阻止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the act prohibits the hearing of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:46.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇对国王企图使婚姻无效申诉的裁决权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the King's nullity suit by the Pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:49.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时也挡住了王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And,by the same token,bars the Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:52.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向梵蒂冈对此申诉裁决结果的反诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From appealing to the Vatican against any decision made here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:53.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所言极是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从未有任何英格兰国王被授予如此绝对权势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No English sovereign has ever been granted such absolute power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:17:59.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 可怜的凯瑟琳 - 更糟糕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Poor Catherine. - It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:03.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是传说国王已与安妮女士秘密完婚 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- There are rumours that the King has married Anne in secret. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:06.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且她已经有孕在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that she is already with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:09.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Eminences.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:13.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为此次合理程序组建的教会法庭结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the conclusion of this properly constituted ecclesiastical court,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:17.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将宣布经由我们一致同意的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am ready to pronounce the verdict agreed by us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:23.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很遗憾有些人不愿到场见证此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a pity that certain persons refused to come here and testify!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:27.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这绝影响不到我们的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that in itself holds no bearing upon our conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:33.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}裁决是 宣布英格兰王亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which are that the union between King Henry of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:37.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与阿拉贡的凯瑟琳的婚姻无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Katherine of Aragon is declared null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:40.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 国王与安妮·波林的婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And therefore,that the King's marriage to Anne Boleyn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:43.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣布合法有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is declared both valid and lawful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:47.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝为证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the eyes of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:54.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:03.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 伊丽莎白？- 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Elizabeth? - Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:06.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那该怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:11.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽未经本人允许 我代表我的女主人来此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came on behalf of my Lady,though not with her permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:17.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 她正遭受着极大的不幸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas,she is in a most wretched way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被遗弃 遭背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Abandoned and betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:23.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王用尽手段羞辱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems so cruel of the King
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实在残酷之极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To humiliate her in every way,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他居然迎娶了那个婊子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pretending to marry that harlot...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.81,0:19:33.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 什么？- 你还没听说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - Did you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:36.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵奉命来通知她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Duke of Suffolk came to tell her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:40.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王已经完婚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the King has married...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.46,0:19:43.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮… 波林？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne...Boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但与我何干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what can I do about any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:57.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你是枢密院委员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are now a Privy Councillor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:00.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是克伦威尔先生的座上宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a client of Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:03.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你可为我的女主人进言求情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you could speak up for my Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:05.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生是最最不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell is the least likely man
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:08.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同情你家女主人的 伊丽莎白 你该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To sympathise with your Mistress. You must know that,Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:11.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要是还对我有点情谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you still have feelings for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:16.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就该为她说句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will speak out for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只好抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:06.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为圣彼得的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As the successor of St. Peter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我庄严地谴责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do solemnly condemn the separation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:13.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰国王和阿拉贡的凯瑟琳的离异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of the King of England from Katherine of Aragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:16.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于他之后的秘密婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And his subsequent secret marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:20.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宣布无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which I declare null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:24.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}兹一事体 关乎国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This matter,of the validity
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:26.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}婚姻是否有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of His Majesty's marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:30.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能由元老院裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can only be decided by the Curia,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:35.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而元老院至今还未下定论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which has not yet reached its conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:38.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给国王在九月之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will give the King until september
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:41.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请回自己的前妻的期限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To take back his former wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:44.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则 将会被逐出教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On pain of excommunication,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:48.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从此脱离神圣教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which is separation from Holy Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:52.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与教团分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From communion,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:55.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与上帝分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:21:58.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 诸位殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,Your Excellencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:03.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请向你们的主人转达我的话 无论何地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may communicate my words to your masters everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:07.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我来 布里列顿阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come with me,Master Brereton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:19.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holy Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:22.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我向您提及的年轻英格兰绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the young English gentleman I was telling you about,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为我们带来了英格兰宫廷的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who brought us the news from the English Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:28.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 威廉·布里列顿阁下 - 我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Master William Brereton. - My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are grateful to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:37.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我们带来这些不幸的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For bringing news of these terrible events
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.43,0:22:40.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并尽力阻止它们的发生表示感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for all you tried to do to prevent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.57,0:22:42.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我试图为您把她除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tried to rid you of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.77,0:22:44.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不幸的是 圣父 我失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But unfortunately,Holy father,I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:47.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁知道呢 我的孩子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who knows,my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:51.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝自有其神秘之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:54.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教坎佩基奥告诉我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal Campeggio tells me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.28,0:22:58.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算留在罗马而不回英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to stay in Rome now, and not return to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.79,0:23:00.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.01,0:23:02.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 圣父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Holy father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:08.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我更愿意和众多有信仰的人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rather remain with the flock of the faithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.17,0:23:15.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布里顿先生 最近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Recently,Master Brereton,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:20.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我颁布了一份新的神圣的教令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have ordained a new and very special Holy order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:22.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是教会军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are the militantis ecclesiae
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.04,0:23:25.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基督的卫士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Soldiers of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:28.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们被称作耶稣会信徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These Jesuits, as they are called,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.25,0:23:33.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些卫士将要走至那些人人畏惧的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These soldiers,will go where others fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.11,0:23:37.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些充满危险的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where often they will meet great danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:41.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为传播天主教的信仰 传达上帝的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In order to promote the catholic faith and take the word of God
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.03,0:23:44.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带给那些异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To heathens and heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:48.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看得出你对此事业充满着热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see already your passion for this cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:50.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳请你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:52.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加入这个教令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join the order,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.15,0:23:55.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加入反抗异教徒的十字军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join the crusade against heresy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.28,0:23:58.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后重回英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And return to England,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:24:00.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至冒着以身殉难的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even at the risk of martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.03,0:24:14.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 陛下有何吩咐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Cromwell. - Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:26.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加冕礼准备得如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are the preparations for the coronation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.21,0:24:27.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切顺利 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're going well, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.98,0:24:39.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望我的人民能爱戴他们的新王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want the people to love their new Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:40.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.69,0:24:44.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我能爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if I can love her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.12,0:24:46.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们为何不能呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why shouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:50.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他们会爱戴新王后的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assure Your Majesty they will love her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.90,0:24:53.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们没有理由不这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And shall have every reason to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.31,0:25:09.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.32,0:25:12.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侯爵夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madame La Marquise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.79,0:25:16.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 是妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Just sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.79,0:25:19.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么样 我的妹妹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are you,sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:22.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们俩都好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are both of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.80,0:25:25.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are both very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.66,0:25:30.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听我说 陛下和我去拜访了一位有名的占星家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen. the King and I have visited a famous astrologer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.66,0:25:32.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他证实了医师的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who confirmed what the physicians say,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.04,0:25:35.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打心底就知道 是个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what I know in my Heart. That it's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.35,0:25:39.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下高兴坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King is overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:42.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他见人就想说 可被我阻止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He keeps wanting to tell people, but I tell him not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.23,0:25:44.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少现在别说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.70,0:25:47.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来看看这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come and look at these.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.22,0:25:50.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荷尔拜因先生设计了各种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holbein has been designing all kinds of things
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.22,0:25:53.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 加冕礼上要用的东西 - 太漂亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- For the coronation procession. - They're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.76,0:25:57.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荷尔拜因先生简直是个天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holbein is indeed a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.60,0:26:02.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你害怕了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.07,0:26:10.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮 你在怕什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.62,0:26:20.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么 只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,it's nothing. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:31.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了 相公？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's wrong,husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.07,0:26:34.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要为国王和她的婊子护驾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to have to attend on the King and that bitch of his
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.28,0:26:35.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那婊子的加冕礼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at her coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.90,0:26:38.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渥西怎么叫她的来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did Wolsey used to call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:41.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑乌鸦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The black crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.47,0:26:44.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你能不能装点小病？- 我本来可以的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Can you not plead some indisposition? - I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:47.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使国王已封我为届时的王室内务总管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even though the King has made me High Constable for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.84,0:26:50.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果我这么做了 陛下一定会要了我的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if I did, His Majesty would remove my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.37,0:26:52.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我就真的"病"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then I should be genuinely indisposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.72,0:26:55.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 那就好好保护你的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well. So keep your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.72,0:26:57.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管怎么说 它都是个漂亮的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a pretty head, in any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:26:59.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不想失去它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I don't want to lose it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.78,0:27:05.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是收起你的认知和怒意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But store up your knowledge and your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.57,0:27:08.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}切忌鲁莽从事 这总是不好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't act impulsively. it's always a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.91,0:27:11.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到有一天 当其他人也想这么做的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But one day,with others so disposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.58,0:27:13.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再把它们释放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}use them both,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.11,0:27:15.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果可以的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.14,0:27:18.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把她拉下台 彻底地毁灭她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring her down and destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.57,0:27:46.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}注意了 注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hear ye,hear ye!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.24,0:27:49.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我们的陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way for His Gracious Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.52,0:27:53.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利国王和安妮·波林女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King Henry,and the Lady Anne Boleyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:55.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}彭布罗克女侯爵让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marquess of Pembroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.68,0:27:59.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让路 让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way! Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:01.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人群呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are the crowds?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.21,0:28:05.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人都哪儿去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.89,0:28:52.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这儿发生了什么事？- 他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What the hell happened here? - He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.01,0:28:54.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 被射杀的 - 我的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Shot! - My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.24,0:28:55.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep the procession moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.18,0:29:09.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:14.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 刚怎么了？- 一场意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What was that? - An accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.59,0:29:16.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下您完全无须担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing for Your Majesty to be concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.25,0:29:19.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有什么能破坏今天的活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For nothing on earth is going to spoil this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:27.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳求造物圣灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Veni, Creator Spiritus
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.88,0:29:30.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}降临我们身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mentus tuorum visita.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.64,0:29:33.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以你圣宠神恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imple superna gratia
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.54,0:29:36.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充满你所造者之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quae tu creasti pectora.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.29,0:29:39.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经由你的指引\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tu septiformis munere,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.54,0:29:43.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把圣父带来我们身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Digitus paternae dexterae;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.34,0:29:46.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一直坚信着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tu rite promissum patris,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:50.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你的指引\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sermone ditans guttura.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.22,0:29:54.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}启发我们的认知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Accende lumen sensibus,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.76,0:29:57.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把爱满溢我们心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Infunde amorem cordibus,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.95,0:30:00.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}减少我们身体的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Infirma nostri corporis,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.69,0:30:06.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坚守我们的美德 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Virtute firmans perpeti. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.59,0:30:13.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.16,0:30:20.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把它给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.86,0:30:32.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以圣·爱德华的王冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With this, St Edward's crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.63,0:30:35.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我庄严地为你加冕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do solemnly crown you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.65,0:30:38.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.67,0:31:01.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And here...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.43,0:31:04.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是两柄元首的权杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are the two sceptres of the sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.16,0:31:10.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿荣誉与高贵永随我们的安妮王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honour and Grace be to our Queen Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.53,0:31:13.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝愿你凡事顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May you prosper,go forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.02,0:31:17.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝愿你能怀有国王的新王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And may you bear a new son of the King's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.83,0:31:20.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是一次企图暗杀行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was an assassination attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是针对你的就是针对王后的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Either upon you or upon the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:28.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 一个男仆被杀了 - 谢谢 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- A groom was killed. - Thank you, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.91,0:31:31.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甜心 怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart. How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:35.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你喜欢这个城市吗？有没有什么不称心的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you like the city? Was not everything well done?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.51,0:31:37.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 太美丽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:40.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是人太少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But so few people!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.67,0:31:44.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们没有脱帽致敬 也没有人欢呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they kept their hats on their heads. And no one shouted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.95,0:31:50.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比起游行我觉得更像一个葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was more like a funeral than a parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.73,0:31:56.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还有一个晚会要参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a party to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.97,0:31:59.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.22,0:32:01.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望你能有微笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.68,0:32:05.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记住 你现在是我的王后了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember, you are my Queen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.03,0:32:10.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.82,0:32:14.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 但是… - 但是我说了 你是我的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But.. - But I said, you are my Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.73,0:32:19.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有人都在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:52.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎么没看到费施尔主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see Bishop Fisher here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.78,0:32:54.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不在 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.50,0:32:57.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那托马斯·莫尔爵士呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where is Sir Thomas more?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.20,0:32:59.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也没看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see him here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.97,0:33:02.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有邀请他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was he not invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.62,0:33:05.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定邀请他了 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was most certainly invited, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:10.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是他自己不想来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he chose not to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.51,0:33:15.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}饿了吗 女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hungry,ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:23.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.03,0:33:29.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然你被任命为今天的王室内务总管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since you were appointed High Constable today,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:31.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}游行中发生的事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened in the procession
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.16,0:33:34.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是你的责任 我要知道是谁开的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was your fault. I want to know who fired that shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.79,0:33:37.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经竭尽全力去调查了 勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am already endeavouring to find out,my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.96,0:33:42.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然相信你 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,I sincerely trust that you are, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:45.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还没有忘记潘宁顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have not for gotten Pennington.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.49,0:33:48.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我认为那是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For I feel that was your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.46,0:34:03.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为波林干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cheers to the Boleyns.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.26,0:34:07.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为波林干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Boleyns!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:12.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰的新王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And England's new Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:55.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛莉 这是为我放的礼花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,Mary! And it's all for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.85,0:35:02.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加冕礼怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How was the coronation?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.73,0:35:04.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷清 乏味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a cold,meagre
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.98,0:35:06.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让人很不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And uncomfortable thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.02,0:35:10.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的缺席很引人注目 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your absence was noted, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.80,0:35:15.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下对于这些怎么看待？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is Her Majesty bearing up under all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.26,0:35:17.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不允许见她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am no longer allowed to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.60,0:35:20.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们之前互通书信也日益艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it is increasingly difficult for us to exchange letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.94,0:35:23.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to try and see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.31,0:35:27.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做很危险 连表达赞美之辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would be so dangerous. Even to speak a word
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.87,0:35:29.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都有入狱的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In her praise is to risk imprisonment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.78,0:35:32.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还是要尽力争取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:37.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回顾过往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been thinking about the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.01,0:35:41.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坚信国王有朝一日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I believed the King to be
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.11,0:35:44.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会成为天主教国家的贤明君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The most enlightened and promising prince in Christendom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.14,0:35:49.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认定他会将英格兰带入全盛时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was sure his reign would be a Golden Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.70,0:35:53.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾寄予厚望…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had such high hopes...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:02.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}费施尔主教已被软禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bishop Fisher has been placed under house arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.07,0:36:06.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要多加小心 尤斯塔斯大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should beware yourself, Eustace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:19.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们行事务必令世人可敬 谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will all be honourable,discreet,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.18,0:36:22.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公正 廉洁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just and thrifty in your conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.30,0:36:26.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们将向世人传达神的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will present a Godly spectacle to others,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:28.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每日出席弥撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attend mass daily
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行为举止应彰显高尚品德的风范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And display a virtuous demeanour.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.59,0:36:37.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}违者立即以免职及放逐论处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On pain of instant dismissal and banishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.67,0:36:38.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}禁止争斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must not quarrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:43.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诅咒 或发表邪恶猥亵之言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Swear... or say evil and lewd things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.20,0:36:46.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做出下流之行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor ever behave lewdly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.45,0:36:53.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们将为世人树立典范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will set a standard for everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.88,0:36:56.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都明白了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.54,0:36:58.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.45,0:37:07.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}禁止出入妓院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you don't go to brothels.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.76,0:37:15.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会在这里放一本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will keep here a copy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.08,0:37:17.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丁道尔所译的英文圣经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of Tyndale's english bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.53,0:37:20.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们可以自由翻阅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of you are free to read it,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.21,0:37:22.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从中汲取其精髓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And draw spiritual nourishment from it...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.32,0:37:24.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旧时代已经过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the old days are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:28.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今一切皆已改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is changed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.66,0:37:33.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}承蒙国王陛下圣恩 各位有幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks to His Majesty, you have all been delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.51,0:37:37.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}挣脱教皇的奴役和黑暗统治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the darkness and bondage of papal thraldom,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.23,0:37:39.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}破除崇拜和迷信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Idolatry and superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:46.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a new beginning. For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.31,0:37:48.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.49,0:37:52.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对英格兰都是崭新的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for England.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.85,0:37:58.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勒德洛城堡 威尔士边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ludlow Castle. The Welsh Marches
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:10.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.27,0:38:13.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛莉小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.44,0:38:17.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来此通知你坎特伯雷大主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have come to inform you of the judgements made recently
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.24,0:38:19.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近期做出的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By His Grace,the Archbishop of Canterbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.87,0:38:22.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下与你母亲的婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty's marriage to your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.45,0:38:24.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被宣判无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has been declared null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.26,0:38:27.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你母亲不再是合法的英格兰王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your mother was never legally Queen of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.23,0:38:30.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须接受亲王太妃头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And must now accept the title of Dowager Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.92,0:38:33.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也不能再自称为公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as you have no longer the right to call yourself princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.04,0:38:36.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从今往后 头衔改为玛莉小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But from now on must be known to all as Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.58,0:38:39.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与此同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.36,0:38:42.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下与安妮王后成婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty's recent marriage to Queen Anne
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.62,0:38:44.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已被宣布合法有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has been declared legal and valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.35,0:38:48.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的加冕礼已在上周举行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her coronation took place in london this past week.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.64,0:38:51.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除我母亲之外 我不知道还有其他英格兰王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know of no Queen of England save my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.49,0:38:54.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我也不会承认其他人的王后资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will accept no other Queen,except my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.46,0:38:58.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.44,0:39:00.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不得不禁止你与你母亲通信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to tell you that you are forbidden to communicate
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.92,0:39:03.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即日起开始执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In any way with your mother, from this day forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:07.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能给她写信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may I not even write to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.43,0:39:09.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一张道别短笺都不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not even a farewell note,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.17,0:39:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}考虑到你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Considering your...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.63,0:39:14.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不妥协的态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Intransigence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.49,0:39:26.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士觐见 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas more, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.16,0:39:36.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.51,0:39:41.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:44.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我如此接见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me for receiving you like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.49,0:39:47.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我身体不适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I do not feel well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.26,0:39:54.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您所遭受的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What you suffer is known.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.01,0:39:55.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世人皆知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To a great many people, both here and abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.40,0:39:59.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事是不公正的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As is the injustice of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.94,0:40:01.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您却以宽厚仁慈之心对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As well as the grace with which you endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.61,0:40:05.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.99,0:40:09.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能再自称王后了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must cease to call myself Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.30,0:40:14.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使我受过加冕礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even though I was crowned so, and anointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:18.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们说如果我拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say that if I refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.01,0:40:23.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王将不再承认我的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King will withdraw his fatherly love for my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.78,0:40:28.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会屈服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall not yield,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.17,0:40:31.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既不是为了我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither for my daughter's sake
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.88,0:40:33.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不是为了其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or anyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.95,0:40:42.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使千人之死 我都不会允许自己去谴责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not for a thousand deaths would I consent to damn my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.29,0:40:46.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我或是我国王丈夫的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or that of my husband the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:53.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请再次原谅 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please forgive me again, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.97,0:40:57.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经不再习惯接见访客了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am not very used to visitors any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.45,0:41:00.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大部分人都会被拦下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are mostly forbidden me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.10,0:41:03.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么得到许可令的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you get permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.95,0:41:06.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲自联系了克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wrote to Mr. Cromwell personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.84,0:41:10.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个勇士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you are a brave man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.40,0:41:15.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不这么做就是懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd be a coward to do otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.06,0:41:19.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法假装对此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot pretend to be detached
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.87,0:41:21.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}漠不关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From these events.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.40,0:41:34.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直力促\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been encouraging
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.63,0:41:36.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会和其他地方的支持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your supporters in parliament, and elsewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.77,0:41:39.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表明他们的立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To speak their minds
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.26,0:41:41.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}支持您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And stand up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.50,0:41:43.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.07,0:41:49.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 托马斯爵士 谢谢 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Sir Thomas. Thank you. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.04,0:42:20.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安妮…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.95,0:42:31.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.55,0:42:38.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能 现在不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.59,0:42:41.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等孩子出生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While the baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.78,0:43:24.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很优雅 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exquisite,isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.50,0:43:33.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃莉诺·鲁克女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Eleanor Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.81,0:43:35.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的家族在牛津郡拥有地产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her family has an estate in Oxfordshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.11,0:43:42.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要我代表你和她谈谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I talk to her on your behalf?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.29,0:44:23.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宫庭生活如何 马克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you like life at court,Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.37,0:44:26.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.08,0:44:30.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我感觉幸运至极 大人 - 至极？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I feel twice fortunate,my Lord. - Twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.74,0:44:32.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}允许我前往此地已是幸事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once for being allowed to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.05,0:44:36.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而得到您家族的资助则幸运至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And twice for the patronage of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.25,0:44:38.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们乐于资助艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We like to patronize artists.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.45,0:44:42.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有才华的人 画家荷尔拜因在我家暂住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Men of talent. The painter Holbein stayed with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.43,0:44:46.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舍妹支援了众多音乐家和唱诗班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my sister supports many musicians and choirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.13,0:44:49.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那么令妹是非常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,well,your sister is quite
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.96,0:44:51.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有才华的音乐家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A talented musician herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.45,0:44:54.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是个非常年轻漂亮的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As well as a very beautiful young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.64,0:44:58.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使这样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even though...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.10,0:45:00.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even though...?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.23,0:45:04.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是没有他哥哥完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not as beautiful as her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.82,0:45:21.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.27,0:45:24.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马元老院的最终决议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The final decision of the curia in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.95,0:45:53.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们作出了对凯瑟琳有利的判决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have found for Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.07,0:45:55.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣布我这次婚姻无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They declare my new marriage invalid,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.57,0:45:57.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何婚生子女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and any children produced from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.87,0:45:58.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都属私生子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Illegitimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.43,0:46:03.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我不悔改重归凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Pope threatens to excommunicate me
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.38,0:46:05.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇威胁要将我逐出教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I do not return to Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.95,0:46:12.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.56,0:46:20.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.09,0:46:28.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坚持住 勇敢极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shh. Hold on. How brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.85,0:46:32.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就要出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.12,0:46:34.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你安排比武 宴会 假面舞会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I want you to organize jousts,banquets and masques.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.95,0:46:36.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庆祝我儿子的诞生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To celebrate the birth of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.35,0:46:41.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还没有决定叫他亨利还是爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't decide whether to call him Henry or Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.48,0:46:44.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经邀请法国大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I've already asked the French ambassador to
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.92,0:46:46.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在洗礼仪式上托住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hold him at the font during his Christening.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.58,0:46:48.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如有任何闪失 那就开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he drops him,it's war.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.69,0:46:54.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是现在 安妮 就是现在 用力推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's here,Anne, it's here! Push!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.72,0:46:57.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}推 推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Push! push!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.02,0:47:07.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是什么 怎么回事 - 没事没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is it? what's happened? - Nothing! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.05,0:47:11.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下产下了非常健康的女婴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty has given birth to a very healthy baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.35,0:47:30.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对此事不觉得震惊吗 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And did you not find such occurrences shocking,Eminency?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.62,0:47:32.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我是威尼斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, I am a Venetian.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.84,0:47:34.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来自\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come from a city
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.13,0:47:37.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充斥着赌徒和娼妓的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where all the men are gamblers and all the women whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.33,0:47:40.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也就不足为奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is there to be shocked about,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.20,0:47:43.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.36,0:48:20.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.49,0:48:26.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都还年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and I are both young,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.10,0:48:31.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有主的庇佑 会生下儿子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And by God's Grace, boys will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.83,0:49:04.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 埃莉诺女士 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lady Eleanor. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.80,0:49:22.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会下棋吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you play chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.48,0:49:24.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.13,0:49:28.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come,let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.24,0:49:48.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我第一步走这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's my first move.
